# Guardrails (always apply)

## Git
- Never push to or merge into main. Work only on feature/<short-description> branches.
- Never merge a PR. Open it and stop; the maintainer (Hang-Kin) reviews and merges.

## Protected files - do NOT edit, rename, move or delete
- mcq-app/proxy.ts (auth/route gate)
- Any .env, .env.local, .env.* file; never print or commit secrets
- rls_setup.sql, supabase_schema.sql, and everything under migrations/

## Database
- No schema changes, migrations, RLS policy changes, or destructive SQL.
- Do not change Supabase queries, API routes (mcq-app/app/api), auth logic, or grading/session logic.

## Scope for UI work
- Allowed: CSS/Tailwind styling, layout components, navigation components, page markup/className changes.
- Do not change behavior: keep form actions, handlers, timers, props and data fetching intact.
- If a task seems to need a protected file, stop and ask.

## Design system
- Clean and minimal. White background, dark tone Pantone 295 (approx #002C5F).
- Use CSS variables from app/globals.css; no hard-coded colors in components.
